{% extends "web/base.html.j2" %}
{% set page_title = "Accessor | WaveformAnalysis" %}
{% set asset_prefix = "../assets/" %}
{% set site_root_prefix = "../" %}
{% set body_class = "docs-page" %}
{% set current = "accessors" %}
{% set current_guide_route = "accessors/index.html" %}
{% set site_home_href = "../index.html" %}
{% set plugin_index_href = "../plugins/index.html" %}
{% set accessor_index_href = "index.html" %}
{% set context_index_href = "../contexts/context.html" %}
{% set adapter_index_href = "../adapters/adapter.html" %}
{% set visualization_index_href = "../visualizations/index.html" %}
{% set visualization_detail_prefix = "../visualizations/" %}
{% block document %}
<main class="docs-main">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="../index.html">文档概览</a><span aria-current="page">Accessor</span></nav>
  <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">分析接口</p><h1>Accessor</h1><p>跨插件组织只读查询、关联与回溯，不重复实现插件的数据处理。</p></header>
  <section class="accessor-responsibility" aria-labelledby="accessor-responsibility-heading">
    <div class="accessor-responsibility-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">职责分工</p>
      <h2 id="accessor-responsibility-heading">Plugin 产出单一数据，Accessor 连接多个产物</h2>
      <p>两者不在同一层工作：插件负责产生可缓存的数据事实，Accessor 负责从分析问题出发组织查询。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="accessor-responsibility-flow">
      <div class="accessor-responsibility-role">
        <span class="category">处理层</span>
        <h3>Plugin</h3>
        <p>每个插件聚焦一个稳定、具名的数据产物，并声明它的依赖、字段、版本和缓存 lineage。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="accessor-responsibility-connector" aria-hidden="true"><span>多个插件产物</span><strong>→</strong></div>
      <div class="accessor-responsibility-role">
        <span class="category">查询层</span>
        <h3>Accessor</h3>
        <p>通过 Context 读取多个插件产物，完成跨插件筛选、关联和回溯，例如从 S1-S2 配对回溯到 peak、通道特征与波形。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="accessor-responsibility-rationale">为什么需要 Accessor：一个插件只对应单个产物，而分析中常见的回溯场景——从 peak 回溯到构成它的 channel，或从 S1-S2 pair 回溯到关联的 peaks——都需要多个插件产物协同才能完成。Accessor 把这种跨产物查询封装为只读接口，避免在插件链路里重复拼装。</p>
    <p class="accessor-responsibility-note"><strong>边界：</strong>Accessor 不属于插件 DAG，不重新执行算法，也不生成新的缓存数据契约。</p>
  </section>
  <section class="accessor-selection" aria-labelledby="accessor-selection-heading">
    <div class="accessor-selection-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">如何选择</p>
      <h2 id="accessor-selection-heading">先确定查询入口，再选 Accessor</h2>
      <p>三个 Accessor 覆盖不同的分析起点：从 peak 看通道、从事件看配对、或直接按 record 读波形。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="table-wrapper"><table>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Accessor</th><th scope="col">查询入口</th><th scope="col">回答的问题</th><th scope="col">适用场景</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for item in selection_guide %}
        <tr>
          <td><a href="{% if item.route %}{{ item.route }}{% else %}{{ item.slug }}.html{% endif %}"><code>{{ item.name }}</code></a></td>
          <td>{{ item.entry | inline_code }}</td>
          <td>{{ item.question }}</td>
          <td>{{ item.scenario }}</td>
        </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <p class="accessor-selection-link">批量查询与组合分析模式见 <a class="inline-reference-link" href="../architecture/accessor-analysis.html">分析查询与批量运行（架构文档）</a>。</p>
  </section>
  <div class="resource-grid">{% for accessor in accessors %}<a class="resource-card" href="{{ accessor.slug }}.html"><span class="category">{{ accessor.name }}</span><h2>{{ accessor.name }}</h2><p>{{ accessor.summary }}</p><span class="card-link">阅读参考</span></a>{% endfor %}<a class="resource-card" href="../contexts/records-view.html"><span class="category">records-backed 波形访问</span><h2>RecordsView</h2><p>按稳定 <code>record_id</code> 访问 <code>records</code> 与 <code>wave_pool</code>，并统一完成窗口、批量填充和信号极性处理。</p><span class="card-link">阅读参考</span></a></div>
  <section class="accessor-common" aria-labelledby="accessor-common-heading">
    <div class="accessor-common-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">共性约定</p>
      <h2 id="accessor-common-heading">所有 Accessor 遵循同一套约定</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>只读查询</strong>：只读取 Context 中已有的产物，不重新执行插件算法。</li>
        <li><strong>显式绑定 <code>run_id</code></strong>：所有数据访问都针对指定 run，不依赖隐式当前状态。</li>
        <li><strong>按需加载</strong>：先读轻量特征或配对表，只有请求波形或绘图时才加载波形层。</li>
        <li><strong>逻辑通道键</strong>：通道统一使用 <code>(board, channel)</code>，不使用 boardless 编号。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
{% endblock %}
